      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please, it would be incredibly useful to have this working in VRChat, especially  twist correction constraint. The current IK forearm/leg rotation does not feel great and trying to mitigate the issue with rotation constraints on twist bones easily introduces flipping when it comes to arms. This would solve one of my biggest gripes when it comes to rigging avatars for VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
